Basically ready to move on to the terminal environment
This also gives some very good insight
The task curriculum will need to be dynamically adjusted to keep the median performance around 0.5
In order to maximize the reward signal's information
+predictive trajectory length estimation so that early easy problems can be batched together and later marathon-level ones processed sequentially
Training will slow down massively from ~60 tok/s with batching to ~30 tok/s but that's just what's needed to squeeze out a meaningful reward signal for the hardest agentic tasks on a single GPU
One week to make Assistant hyperintelligent is a small price to pay.
